     "En ZIP med pack.txt och dess bilder i en mapp, eller en texturpaketmod (mod.toml och textures/pack.txt), som beskrivs i MODDING.md. Den kontrolleras innan något installeras."},
    {"A ZIP with one folder holding mod.toml (a settings or cutscenes mod) and its files, as MODDING.md describes. It is checked before anything is installed.",
